OL,3,GNEWSADate set for historic market's
OL,4,Aopening at new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been announced for the
OL,7,Fopening of a new Merseyside market,
OL,8,Fafter months of wrangling over its
OL,9,Fcontroversial relocation.
OL,11,FThe former TJ Hughes site at the
OL,12,FPyramids Shopping Centre will become
OL,13,FBirkenhead Market's new home after
OL,14,Ftraders objected to previous plans to
OL,15,Fmove it to the town's former Argos
OL,16,Fstore.
OL,18,FBusinesses were split over the move to
OL,19,Fthe TJ Hughes location, with some
OL,20,Fsaying they "couldn't wait", while
OL,21,Fothers strongly objected.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
