OL,3,GNEWSADate set for historic market's
OL,4,Aopening at new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FFull planning permission for works at
OL,7,Fthe site has now been approved and the
OL,8,Frelocation is expected to see the new
OL,9,Fmarket open on 25 February 2027, Wirral
OL,10,FCouncil said.
